      "note": "read and write register tables, communication settings"
    },
    {
      "title": "cFos YTL DTS353 Modbus Registers",
      "note": "the same table as published by cFos for its EV charger integration; matches the matrix"
    },
    {
      "title": "Home Assistant community: Read YTL5300 (DTS353F2) with Modbus",
      "url": "https://community.home-assistant.io/t/read-ytl5300-dts353f2-with-modbus-modbus-crc-check-failed/388371",
      "note": "a user reads the voltages, currents, powers and energy from 0x000E and 0x0100 as FP32 holding registers at 9600 8E1; no values were compared"
    }
